The Mercedes-Benz A-Class AMG PETRONAS 2015 World Champion Edition is based on the W176 facelift A45 AMG. It features the 381 hp 2.0L turbocharged engine, 7-speed DCT, and 4MATIC AWD. This was a limited edition model celebrating Mercedes-AMG Petronas F1 team's championship win in 2015. It included cosmetic enhancements like Petronas green accents and decals, an aero package, and specific interior trim, often bundled with the AMG Dynamic Plus package (including adaptive damping and a front limited-slip differential) and the AMG Exclusive Package.

